      "mergedPostDetails": "Description:\n\nNotifications only show up at the start of a session, then stop updating.\n\nSocial tab shows friends online when they’re not, and lists friends in worlds where they aren’t.\n\nOnly fixes if I restart VRChat.\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n\nLaunch VRChat.\n\nNotifications appear at session start.\n\nPlay for a while (no new notifications show).\n\nOpen Social tab (friend/world info is outdated).\n\nRestart VRChat (everything updates correctly again).\n\nExpected: Notifications and Social tab should update in real time.\n\nActual: They stop refreshing mid-session and only reset after a restart.\n\nPlatform: pc\n\nConnection: wired\n\nHappens every session after 30-60 mins time in-game.",
